Root cause:
The bug was caused by the lack of tracing for the Runnable tasks submitted to the `binningThreadPool`, which led to the loss of `sendMutation` events. By wrapping the Runnable with `Trace.wrap`, the system can now properly track and log these events, ensuring that they are not lost during execution.
